{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2021a.q39.material.recovered", "text": "（材料）程老师给高一年级48名女生上排球模块选项课，为了改进排球垫球技术。教学安排如下：基本部分：教师首先结合挂图讲解和组织学生示范，然后将学生分成8个“小群体”进行练习。具体步骤：①教师向小群体发教学卡片；②先后集合小组长3次，小组长简要反映学习状况。教师提出新要求，其他学生不间断练习；③穿插进行“自垫球”和“对垫球”比赛，各组记录员登记次数，各组比赛成绩在小黑板上公布。结束部分：记录员、安全员、器材保管员报告有关情况。小组进行小结，然后全班集合，教师作扼要点评。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3674c8433ddee17d832cc39889c0f85950efdc77a9c6c2c2993203b13fdf6097", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3057, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3292, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 39, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "3674c8433ddee17d832cc39889c0f85950efdc77a9c6c2c2993203b13fdf6097"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2021a.q39"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r005", "ntce.outline.413.r008", "ntce.outline.413.r011", "ntce.outline.413.r018", "ntce.outline.413.r019", "ntce.outline.413.r027", "ntce.outline.413.r030"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2021a.q39"], "word_count": 235, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3674c8433ddee17d832cc39889c0f85950efdc77a9c6c2c2993203b13fdf6097", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3057, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3292, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_exc